"{\"duration_seconds\":10,\"aspect_ratio\":\"9:16\",\"framing\":\"full-bleed vertical, no bands\",\"style\":\"3D cartoon, Pixar quality, deadpan satire, warm light\",\"motion_rule\":\"HIS BODY crosses the frame edge to edge in EVERY window, talking ones too; a moving prop alone never counts; the camera never carries a window alone; he never holds a pose; new shot size every window\",\"camera_moves\":\"macro 0.0, low 0.6, 3/4 1.55, wide 2.7, floor 4.2, over him 6.5, wide 9.5\",\"character\":\"a plump velvet mole, tiny eyes, huge pink shovel-paws, dusty, utterly serious\",\"second_characters\":\"ONE digger above, never a face, only a rusty SHOVEL blade through the roof\",\"props\":\"CALCULATOR: chunky cream plastic, BLANK buttons and screen. CHEST: a battered wooden trunk, iron bands, a loose ring. BOOTS: two split boots. HAT: a crushed felt hat\",\"prop_continuity\":\"the calculator never lights up; the ringing comes from the earth, never from the device\",\"environment\":\"a round burrow, roots overhead, packed soil floor\",\"lighting\":\"bright light from a hole above, dust motes lit, high exposure; gold only from 8.1\",\"audio\":{\"language\":\"Russian, lines verbatim; latin hints never spoken\",\"delivery\":\"calm businesslike male voice, even 4.3 syllables/sec, never drawn out\",\"pronunciation\":\"kal-ku-LYA-tor, do-HOD-nost, zve-NIT, soy-DYOT\",\"pacing\":\"speech 0.6-3.4 and 4.2-6.5 with one break; voiceless 6.5-9.53; one word at 9.53, sfx keep going\",\"lip_sync\":\"mouth opens and closes on every syllable\",\"sfx\":\"a dry plastic click, a shovel in soil, one dull iron chime under the floor at 3.6, more joining and spreading through the walls, the burrow ringing by 6.5, the lid banging out of frame\",\"music\":\"none until 8.1, then a soft burbling music box\"},\"timeline\":[{\"t\":\"0.0-0.6\",\"a\":\"silent. He bursts out of the soil wall and hurls himself across the whole frame, the blank calculator in one paw\"},{\"t\":\"0.6-1.55\",\"line\":\"Калькулятор\",\"a\":\"he charges left to right along the burrow, his whole body crossing the frame, roots whipping over his back\"},{\"t\":\"1.55-2.70\",\"line\":\"обещал найти\",\"a\":\"he slams the far wall and rebounds off it right to left across the whole frame, a sheet of soil dragged with him\"},{\"t\":\"2.70-3.40\",\"line\":\"доходность.\",\"a\":\"he throws his weight onto the big blank button; the recoil flings him and the dead calculator right across the frame\"},{\"t\":\"3.40-4.20\",\"a\":\"silent. The rusty SHOVEL stabs down through the roof at his head and he throws himself the whole width of the burrow clear of it, earth blasting. The floor rings under him\"},{\"t\":\"4.20-5.35\",\"line\":\"Осталось найти,\",\"a\":\"the shovel rips back out and the wall goes with it; he rides the falling soil the whole height of the frame and swings up on a root\"},{\"t\":\"5.35-6.50\",\"line\":\"откуда звенит.\",\"a\":\"he loses the root and tumbles head over heels across the floor edge to edge, slamming into the far wall\"},{\"t\":\"6.50-7.30\",\"a\":\"silent. He digs like a machine, his body driving down into the floor, earth blasting into the lens\"},{\"t\":\"7.30-8.10\",\"a\":\"silent. The shovel hooks the chest and rips it out of the soil; he chases it the whole width of the burrow and slams onto the lid\"},{\"t\":\"8.10-8.90\",\"a\":\"silent. He rips the lid up and flings it out of frame; GOLD light blasts over him, inside two split boots and a crushed hat\"},{\"t\":\"8.90-9.53\",\"a\":\"silent. He stamps into the boots, jams the hat on and holds the blank calculator up as a mirror, turning across the frame\"},{\"t\":\"9.53-10.0\",\"line\":\"Сойдёт?\",\"a\":\"he wipes his nose with one dirty paw, the brim slides over his eyes and he blunders over the chest across the frame\"}],\"must_appear\":\"the shovel down at 3.4 and 7.3, boots and a crushed hat in the chest, the gold light at 8.1, the calculator as a mirror, the dirty paw across his nose at the end\",\"negative_prompt\":\"black bands, letterbox, digits, letters, cyrillic, a lit calculator screen, coins, bullion, subtitles, watermark, night, dark scene, dim light, a face above ground, a second mole, slow motion, a pivot in place, a static wide at the end, any voice between 6.5 and 9.5\"}"